:name: F91 Jepler Emulator (nRF52840)
:description: This script runs the Zephyr RTOS firmware for the f91_jepler on a virtual nRF52840.

using sysbus
$name?="nRF52840"
mach create $name

machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/cpus/nrf52840.repl

# We can connect a virtual SSD1306 display here on the I2C bus later.
# For now, it will just boot the MCU and allow flashing/debugging.

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
"""

runMacro $reset
